{
  "title": "讨论面板",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>讨论面板</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">当您在条目窗口的侧边栏中单击 <span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; font-weight: bold;\">显示讨论面板</span> 时，讨论面板将出现在窗口的右侧。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">讨论面板允许您查看已有消息，并创建新的评论和回复。</p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\"> <img src=\"/aras-images/discpanel.jpg\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">要了解有关条目独立窗口中讨论面板功能的更多信息，请参阅以下主题：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">讨论面板工具栏</a></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">讨论面板</a></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">创建评论</a></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">消息类型</a></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">消息功能</a></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">消息排序选项</a></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">消息搜索和筛选选项</a></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">使用 @提及</a></p>\n  \n  \n  \n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Discussion_Panel.htm"
}